# ==============================================================================
# GEOSYS DEVELOPMENT INC. - CAMA-TOOLS PROJECT GITIGNORE
# Description: Configured to prevent tracking of compiled bytecode, local build
#              artifacts, environment logs, and developer-specific configurations.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python Bytecode and Caches
# Prevents Python compiled files from clogging the repository and causing
# binary merge conflicts during stash or branch merges.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Virtual Environment
# The venv/ folder is machine-specific (absolute interpreter paths baked in)
# and can run into the hundreds of MB -- never committed. Every developer
# recreates it locally via `python -m venv venv` + reinstalling requirements.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
venv/
.venv/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PyInstaller and Build Outputs
# Excludes local executable generation outputs. Note: The .spec file is kept
# tracked if it contains project-wide deployment configurations.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
*.pkg
*.exe
*.toc

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment Profiles and Runtime Logs
# Prevents local runtime activity and environment logs from being committed.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
cache/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local Configuration Files / Credentials
# Target specific application state settings or credentials to avoid overwriting
# other developers' configurations. Generic *.json tracking is permitted
# unless explicitly ignored here.
#
# NOTE: patterns below with no leading/embedded slash already match at any
# depth (e.g. also covers "other tools/pg_credentials.json",
# "archive/other tools/pg_credentials.json", etc.). The explicit "**/" forms
# are kept anyway for readability -- so nobody has to know gitignore's
# no-slash-matches-anywhere rule to trust that nested copies are covered too.
#
# IMPORTANT: this rule only blocks *new* files from being tracked. If a copy
# was already committed before this rule existed (or was force-added), it must
# be explicitly untracked once with `git rm --cached <path>` -- .gitignore
# alone will not remove something already in the index/history.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
pg_credentials.json
**/pg_credentials.json
gm_exe_path.json
**/gm_exe_path.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / IDE Settings
# Developer-specific editor configuration -- not part of the project itself.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS-Generated Files
# Filesystem metadata Windows/macOS create automatically -- never intentional.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store